---
layout: base.njk
title: Ballot Measures
description: Plain-language guides to Ohio Issue 3 and the Conneaut data-center charter amendment, with the effect of YES and NO votes.
permalink: /measures/index.html
---

<div class="directory-page directory-measures">
  <div class="directory-heading">
    <span class="directory-eyebrow"><span aria-hidden="true">▤</span> Understand each question</span>
    <h1>Ballot measures</h1>
    <p class="directory-lede">These summaries explain what the ballot text would change. They do not recommend how to vote. Check your official sample ballot to see which local questions appear for you.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="directory-grid directory-measure-grid">
    {% for measure in measures %}
      {% set measurePath = '/measures/' + measure.id + '/' %}
      <article class="directory-card directory-measure-card">
        <div class="directory-card-meta"><span class="directory-badge directory-badge-measure">Issue {{ measure.issue_number }}</span><span>Official ballot question</span></div>
        <h2><a href="{{ measurePath | url }}">{{ measure.title }}</a></h2>
        <p class="directory-summary">{{ measure.plain_english }}</p>
        <a class="directory-action" href="{{ measurePath | url }}">Read what YES and NO mean <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <a class="directory-feature-link" href="{{ '/measures/liquor/' | url }}"><span><strong>Sunday liquor questions</strong><small>View the three precinct-specific local-option questions</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
</div>
